      "feedback": "钥匙藏回内袋，林岚登船。",
      "consequence": {
        "horizon": "ending",
        "description": "保留钥匙和解释权，但今晚无法查明柜内物品。",
        "readAtNodeIds": [
          "node_route",
          "node_leave"
        ]
      }
    },
